{"id":"906faf39b94540bc","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-boolean-valued-relation.md","title":"Boolean-Valued Relation","display":"df-boolean-valued-relation — Boolean-Valued Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_verification":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified","type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-boolean-valued-relation","aliases":["17-df-boolean-valued-relation"],"display":"df-boolean-valued-relation — Boolean-Valued Relation","depends_on":["[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-6.1.1b"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-boolean-valued-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-boolean-valued-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-valued-relation — Boolean-Valued Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fe577fb2b2dc26d9\" href=\"?note=fe577fb2b2dc26d9\" title=\"17-df-boolean-algebra\">17-df-boolean-algebra</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-6.1.1b"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (nonempty set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{B}=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak{B}=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BA}(\\mathfrak{B})\">\\(\\operatorname{BA}(\\mathfrak{B})\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fe577fb2b2dc26d9\" href=\"?note=fe577fb2b2dc26d9\" title=\"17-df-boolean-algebra\">17-df-boolean-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n(A,\\mathfrak{B})\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n(A,\\mathfrak{B})\\)</span> (class defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n(A,\\mathfrak{B})\n=\n\\{r:A^n\\to B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n(A,\\mathfrak{B})\n=\n\\{r:A^n\\to B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>A Boolean-valued <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-ary relation assigns a truth value in the Boolean algebra to\neach <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-tuple.  Ordinary relations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq A^n\">\\(R\\subseteq A^n\\)</span> are recovered when\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> by taking the characteristic function of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>; they are not themselves\nequal to the whole power set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(A^n)\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(A^n)\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"fe577fb2b2dc26d9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"fe577fb2b2dc26d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{B}=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle$ ($\\operatorname{BA}(\\mathfrak{B})$, see [[17-df-boolean-algebra]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{B}=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BA}(\\mathfrak{B})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n(A,\\mathfrak{B})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n(A,\\mathfrak{B})\n=\n\\{r:A^n\\to B\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq A^n","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{P}(A^n)","display":false}],"bytes":1193,"backlinks":[{"id":"ba828dd62ddf0d50","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L',n}\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})$；$\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n$ 见 [[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[